      <p class="lead"><strong>The market has split into several useful philosophies.</strong> Some tools are digital pegboards. Some optimise live pairings from ratings and waiting time. Some generate the entire night's fixture sheet in advance. Others start with bookings and payments and add the court board around them.</p>

      <p>That means the best choice depends less on the longest feature list than on which problem currently consumes your organiser's attention.</p>

      <p style="color:var(--muted-2);font-size:.95rem"><strong>Disclosure:</strong> this comparison is published by ePegboard, so we are not an independent reviewer. We checked competitors' public product and pricing pages on 26 August 2026 and have tried to describe their strengths as we would want ours described. We have not run a full club night on every product. Features and prices can change; verify anything material with the supplier before deciding.</p>
